tools/.ota_counts and the item is skipped once either slot reaches its limit.
Packaging requires boot.img/system.img/oem.img in the firmware directory.

USB profile note: the test switches high->medium->low and restores high each round,
checks the module-side usb_profile value after each reboot, and leaves it high.

Manual tools (in bin/ after extracting the package):
  ./bin/uvc_host_preview          Live preview (Ctrl+C to stop)
  ./bin/uvc_host_isp_cli          Interactive 3A / fps

